              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la tesi — \"the thesis, the position (argued for)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La sua tesi è semplice: lavoriamo troppo. His thesis is simple: we work too much."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The same in the plural: le tesi. At university, la tesi is the dissertation."
            }
          ]
        },
