          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "argomentazione is a learned borrowing from Latin argūmentātiō \"the bringing of proof\" (Lewis & Short), from argūmentum \"proof, evidence\", built on arguere \"to make clear, to prove\"."
            }
          ]
        },
